            <div xml:id="d393">

                <pb facs="0728" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1946v01/pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">890.0146/12–746</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Under Secretary of State</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Acheson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to President Truman
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-12-11">December 11, 1946</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am forwarding herewith, for your information, the translation of a note from
                    the Soviet Embassy dated December 7, 1946. The Soviet Government expresses the
                    view in this note that the question of trusteeship over the islands formerly
                    under Japanese mandate, as well as over any Japanese islands, must be considered
                    by the Allied Powers in the peace settlement in regard to Japan.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dean Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d393-a1.xml" xpointer="d393-a1"/>
